<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-PENEV FACES FINE FROM CLUB FOR MISSING GAME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PENEV FACES FINE FROM CLUB FOR MISSING GAME.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian striker Lyuboslav Penev faces a heavy fine from Spanish club Compostela after failing to travel to last Sunday's first division match at Racing Santander.</p>
<p>&quot;He will be fined, it's not the first time,&quot; club president Jose Maria Caneda said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Penev said he had not made the trip because of injury. The match was drawn 2-2.</p>
</text>
